From: AlessandroRCL <alessandro.1901.ramiro@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:32:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(notifications): send push notifications with
 Firebase Cloud Messaging (TS06)

The app registers its device token and the leak alerts (US15, US19) and the low
level of the tanks (US29) are sent as push notifications after their transaction
commits. Every attempt is recorded and a token rejected by the provider is marked
as no longer valid. Without FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS_BASE64 the attempts are recorded
as DISABLED, so development and tests do not depend on Firebase.
